WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:06,430
Lao Liu, you really got it right.

2
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:11,430
Little Master, it was my fault a few days ago

3
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,630
I shouldn't scold you

4
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:14,430
Can you evacuate the disaster?

5
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,230
You've been feeling particularly unlucky lately

6
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,430
Drinking cold water will hurt your teeth, right?

7
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:22,180
I've been unlucky ever since you left.

8
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,610
There's a female ghost following behind you. She

9
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:25,610
who is she

10
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,210
oval face, willow eyebrows

11
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,610
Big Mouth, Eagle Fat, Chaotian Nose

12
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:32,210
There is a substantia nigra in her left ear. She is in her 30s.

13
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,210
she is dead

14
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,210
No, it's impossible

15
00:00:34,210 --> 00:00:35,210
When did she die?

16
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,210
You don't make it clear

17
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,210
Not only you suffer

18
00:00:37,210 --> 00:00:38,810
Your wife and children also suffered

19
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:40,960
I met her six years ago

20
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,160
Chasing for several months

21
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,560
I said I would marry her

22
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:45,260
she is pregnant

23
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,460
I gave her 30,000 yuan to abort it, but later she asked

24
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:49,280
I admit that I have been married

25
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,280
she disappeared

26
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:52,140
If you have anything to hide

27
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,140
Even the King of Heaven, I can’t save you even if I come here
